H1 = "Lagos Fashion Week makes space for fashion’s business side"
DEK = "From fashion-business sessions to a retail presentation, Wednesday’s programme put the work around the clothes in view."
META = "Flavor Fashion · 29 Oct 2026 · 3 min read"
